{%- comment -%}
  Outputs a metafield price as integer cents (or nothing when blank).
  Accepts a money metafield value (money object) or a plain number
  in major units (e.g. 2490 = 2 490 Kč).

  Usage:
    {%- capture rrp_cents -%}{%- render 'money-meta-cents', value: product.metafields.custom.rrp.value -%}{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- assign rrp_cents = rrp_cents | strip | plus: 0 -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  if value == blank
    echo ''
  elsif value.amount
    echo value.amount | times: 100 | round
  else
    echo value | times: 100 | round
  endif
-%}
